e, a large window allows natural light to illuminate the room and provides a view of an urban environment with buildings and greenery visible outside. The lighting in the scene is evenly distributed, suggesting it was taken during daylight hours. The visible portion of the chair appears to be leather, with a reddish-brown tone, complementing the overall professional atmosphere of the setting.  \n\n---", "The image shows a person with long, wavy, dark brown hair standing outdoors. The person is wearing a striped outfit featuring navy blue and white vertical stripes, with a pointed collar in navy blue. The background displays a vibrant, green, grassy lawn, surrounded by well-manicured bushes and trees. A red brick building with white-framed windows is visible in the midground, suggesting the setting could be a campus or residential area. The atmosphere appears calm and bright, with natural lighting indicating it’s daytime.  \n\n---", "The image shows a woman seated indoors near a window with ample natural light. She has long, wavy, dark brown hair that appears styled and glossy, cascading over her shoulders. She is wearing a light gray blazer over a pale yellow top, giving her a professional yet approachable appearance. The setting features modern interiors, possibly an office or a sophisticated living space. Behind her, a large glass window offers a view of urban buildings, while a wooden panel and a small plant in the background add warmth and detail to the environment. The lighting is soft and balanced, enhancing the overall clarity of the scene. \n\n---"], "inputs": [{"name": "text", "link": 66, "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "type": "ShowText|pysssss", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#335", "size": [320.1928405761719, 1192], "pos": [3386.8193359375, -1275.269775390625], "id": 31, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfyui-custom-scripts", "ver": "bbda5e52ad580c13ceaa53136d9c2bed9137bd2e", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R"